--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 446ca2583752e9d4d887e78137bed050, type: 3}
  m_Name: Intro DIalogue
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  lines:
  - speakerName: Arabella
    text: Greetings Traveller!
    choices: {fileID: 0}
  - speakerName: Arabella
    text: You must be here to finally get your companion!
    choices: {fileID: 0}
  - speakerName: Arabella
    text: Before you do so, let me tell you a bit of information that will be helpful
      to you.
    choices: {fileID: 0}
  - speakerName: Arabella
    text: Your companion will always try to bond with you to be closer united!
    choices: {fileID: 0}
  - speakerName: Arabella
    text: Once you get your companion, you can press [TAB] to view your bond.
    choices: {fileID: 0}
  - speakerName: Arabella
    text: Careful venturing out there though. Celestria isn't safe like it once was.
    choices: {fileID: 0}
  - speakerName: Arabella
    text: If you are in trouble, you can press [SPACE] to attack enemies!
    choices: {fileID: 0}
  - speakerName: Arabella
    text: Companions will also help you defeat enemies and will always be there for
      you.
    choices: {fileID: 0}
  - speakerName: Arabella
    text: Now about getting your companion! Head on over in the little house straight
      ahead [RIGHT CLICK} to open the door.
    choices: {fileID: 0}
  - speakerName: Arabella
    text: Good luck out there!
    choices: {fileID: 0}
